notes: Source-specific Oxoid preparation in the BHI branch of TOGO M2811. The separate
  Braziers-agar branch names Bioconnections and is excluded. Current Oxoid SR0096E
  supplier capture is related-product context only; catalogue number, freeze-dried
  form and one-vial/500mL instructions are not projected onto this source. The0.04%
  cysteine, BHI broth and anaerobic gases are receiving-medium conditions, not supplement
  components. Generic C. difficile supplement is provenance-only, not a resolving
  synonym.
